Uploaded media is currently served by ID without authentication, so these captures do not establish private-media handling. Search filters apply after FTS pagination, and restoring an entry was not exercised in this study. Licensed Cartesia narration, paired Remotion films, timed captions, release annotations and an exceptional approved poster remain open.
